## New Features

### Stereo Overview Plot
- [ ] Implement `Visualization.specgram_overview` for stereo signals with layout:
  - Row 1: L and R waveforms (shared time axis)
  - Row 2: L octave band spectrogram
  - Row 3: R octave band spectrogram
  - Row 4: ILD per band over time | L vs R band levels
  - Row 5: IPD per band over time | Mean coherence per band
- [ ] ILD = `20 * log10(rms_L / rms_R)` per octave band over sliding window
- [ ] IPD via `inst_cmplx_corr` applied to octave bank output
- [ ] Coherence magnitude from same `inst_cmplx_corr` call

### `FilterBank`
- [ ] Add `ButterworthBank` mixed-order coefficient storage — current padded array wastes
      memory when filter orders vary. Consider list of SOS arrays instead
- [ ] Expose filter states in `filt` for block-processing use case —
      current implementation discards states, causing transient artefacts at block boundaries

### `ModificationMixin`
- [ ] `delay` with `method='sample'`: emit warning when requested delay is not
      an integer number of samples

### `FrequencyDomainSignal`
- [ ] `phase_shift` sign convention comment — explain why `np.sign(self.freq)` is used
      and what it achieves for real-valued output preservation